>
    <label>Test Coverage - EmptyResultBehavior Fail</label>
    <protected>false</protected>
    <values>
        <field>Record_Health_Check_Set__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Account_Query_Coverage</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>CheckName__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >Has at Least One Closed Won Opportunity</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Tooltip__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >If Query Finds No Records = Fail: no matching records means the check fails. Use it when an empty result is itself the problem — here, no Closed Won opportunities means the account has never converted. How To Interpret Query Results = AnyRowPasses passes for any record that exists, so Fail fires only when none do.</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>CheckMethod__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Query</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>DataQuery__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >SELECT Amount FROM Opportunity WHERE AccountId = {!Id} AND StageName = &apos;Closed Won&apos;</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>FieldToRead__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Amount</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>WhenMultipleRows__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">AnyRowPasses</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Operator__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">GreaterThanOrEqual</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>CompareAgainst__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">FixedValue</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>FixedValue__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">0</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>WhenZeroRows__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Fail</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>WhenValueIsEmpty__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">SkipRecordsWithMissingValue</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Severity__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Warning</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>MessageWhenFailed__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >{!Name} has no Closed Won opportunities. This account has not yet converted.</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>RunThisCheckWhen__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Always</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>RunOrder__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:double">80</value>
